          "sid": "body-t1-s01",
          "c": "我頭好痛。",
          "j": "ngo5 tau4 hou2 tung3.",
          "e": "My head really hurts.",
          "note": "To say a body part hurts, name it as the topic then describe it — 我頭好痛 (ngo5 tau4 hou2 tung3) \"my head really hurts\", literally \"I, head, very hurts\". No \"my\" (嘅 (ge3)) needed. 痛 (tung3) is \"to hurt / be sore\".",
          "bd": [
            {
              "c": "我",
              "j": "ngo5",
              "e": "my"
            },
            {
              "c": "頭",
              "j": "tau4",
              "e": "head"
            },
            {
              "c": "好痛",
              "j": "hou2 tung3",
              "e": "really hurts"
            }
          ]
        },
